      <activity id="42e4a53a-22fc-5587-83ad-7d84e33296c3" activityNameId="db771803-bdd3-558d-886f-10ea9faa0045" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Electricity, at cogen 15kWth, natural gas, economic allocation</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Electricity, at cogen 15kWth, natural gas, economic allocation
Inventory for 1 MJ heat from natural gas, burned in a cogeneration unit with a capacity of 15 kWth. The multioutput process "natural gas, burned in cogen 15kWth delivers the coproducts "heat, at cogen 15kWth, natural gas, allocation exergy" and "electricity, at cogen 15kWth, natural gas, allocation exergy". The energy efficiency is 26% for electricity and 67% for heat. The economic factor is 0.72 for electricity and 0.28 for heat. This leads to the allocation factor of 0.5 for electricity and 0.5 for heat.;
UUID: facedb50-77bd-33e3-a39e-bc0d3ef12015
Included are the natural gas burning in a 15kW cogen unit which in turn includes fuel input, infrastructure (boiler), air and water emissions and electrictiy needed for operation. The efficiency and economic allocation is considered
Location: Data apply to the combustion in Switzerland.
Technology: efficiency of average technology available on the market
Time period: Time of publications.
Production volume: na
Sampling: Data from literature 
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_facedb50-77bd-33e3-a39e-bc0d3ef12015.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
